\newlabel{tab:geo}{{II}{10}{Center coordinates normalized by $u_*$ for $n,h,S$ and $u_*^2$ for $\kappa _g\varepsilon _N,\kappa _gq$. Diagonal tuples display the complete diagonal center tensors; all off-diagonal entries and $a$ vanish. Ranks refer to geometry and joint maps}{table.2}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Deterministic images of four declared initial-data ellipsoids. Left: 577 prescribed probes per center and conservative whole-set bounds in scalar and tensor projections. Middle: center Ricci spectra and conservative tensor radii. Right: singular values of the six-component geometry Jacobian, not the ten-component joint map. Probe clouds visualize the sets; the whole-set quadratic enclosure establishes the stated separation. Center labels name witness presentations, and the two flat centers describe the same local intrinsic Euclidean geometry. No empirical probability or coverage is assigned.}}{10}{figure.7}\protected@file@percent }
